        "Description": "xlnt is a C++ library for reading and writing Excel files (xlsx). All dependencies (libstudxml, miniz, utfcpp) are embedded. A patch (xlnt_ohos.patch) adds __OHOS__ platform recognition in source/utils/path.cpp, using <limits.h> instead of <linux/limits.h>."
